WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.400
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.400
Now, if you don't mind,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.901
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:07.200
Eric Trump took
the witness stand today

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.367
in the Trump Organization's
$250 million civil fraud trial.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:14.734
Though, does anyone believe they
told Eric what was going on?

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:15.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:17.300
What's he going
to testify about?

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.234
The magazines
and the outer office?

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:23.133
"Yeah, there was
a 'Car and Driver' from 2009

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:26.033
and some 'Golf Digests,'
I think."

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.267
Donald Trump Jr.
took the witness stand yesterday

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.033
in Manhattan Supreme Court
and testified

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:32.334
about his various
duties and responsibilities

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:33.801
at the Trump Organization.

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:36.234
His job was to let
his dad slap him

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:38.067
whenever Eric wasn't around.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:43.067
The Texas Rangers defeated
the Arizona Diamondbacks

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.667
last night to win
the World Series,

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:46.734
which came as a shock
to Mets fans

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:48.667
who thought baseball
ended in August.

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:53.067
Fox News host Sean Hannity

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:55.400
had a live show last night
from the Capitol.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.934
Said his viewers,
"Hey, I've been there!"

00:00:57.934 --> 00:01:00.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:04.100
According to an analysis of his
personal financial disclosures,

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.534
House speaker Mike Johnson
does not have a bank account.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.968
He keeps trying to open one,
but no one at the bank

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:12.834
will believe his name
is Mike Johnson.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.200
"It's really my name,

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:18.067
and I really live
123 Main Street!"

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.767
That's right.
House speaker Mike Johnson's

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.467
personal financial disclosures

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:24.801
show no investments,
bank account or assets.

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.067
Though, in his defense,
that's probably the only reason

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:29.834
why George Santos hasn't
stolen his identity yet.

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:32.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.267
80-year-old Congresswoman
Kay Granger

00:01:34.267 --> 00:01:36.701
announced yesterday that
she will not seek reelection

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:39.000
because at that age,
it's time to kick back

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.267
and run for president.

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:44.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:46.200
It was announced yesterday

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.167
that the 2023 Rockefeller Center
Christmas tree

00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:50.934
will be an 80-foot-tall,

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:53.667
12-ton Norway spruce
from Vestal, New York,

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:56.734
continuing the long tradition
of coming from upstate

00:01:56.734 --> 00:01:58.167
to get in everybody's way.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:01.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.234
Celebrity chef Guy Fieri's
line of malt beverages,

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:06.467
Flavortown Spiked,
recently unveiled

00:02:06.467 --> 00:02:08.234
a new fruit punch flavor.

00:02:08.234 --> 00:02:11.334
"Flavortown Spiked" is also
what he asked for at Supercuts.

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:15.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:17.501
In the end, that had nothing
to do with the fact

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.267
they have
a new fruit punch flavor.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:24.634
We need to write jokes
about the news that happened.

00:02:24.634 --> 00:02:27.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.033 --> 00:02:28.267
According to a new survey,

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:31.334
88% of doctors said
it was likely

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:33.501
that patients would receive
some misinformation

00:02:33.501 --> 00:02:36.434
when asking AI chat bots
for medical information,

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.667
like this guy who's
going through menopause.

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:41.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:43.601
Starbucks unveiled
its holiday menu yesterday,

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:47.133
which includes a new
iced gingerbread oatmilk chai,

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:49.868
which is great if you're looking
for something both seasonal

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:52.033
and humiliating
to say out loud.

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:55.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:57.734
"I'll just take that new --
the new one.

00:02:57.734 --> 00:02:59.334
The -- The new one over there."

00:02:59.334 --> 00:03:01.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.267 --> 00:03:03.133
According to a new study,
men who picked up

00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:05.167
their cellphones
more than 20 times a day

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.801
have 21%
lower sperm concentration.

00:03:07.801 --> 00:03:09.667
Which begs the question:

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:11.534
what are they picking it up
with?

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:15.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:18.267
Hold on. I just got a text.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:22.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:24.801
Wasn't important.

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:27.334
And finally, the footwear
company Crocs has partnered

00:03:27.334 --> 00:03:29.901
with McDonald's
to release a new line of shoes.

00:03:29.901 --> 00:03:32.567
So now you can show people
you've given up twice.

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:35.801
And that -- that was
a monologue, everybody.

